# Every Dockerfile in this repo names what it wants via per-entry `COPY` lines rather than
# `COPY .`. This file exists only to keep stale
# local build output (and other things no image ever wants) out of the build context; it is
# not an allowlist, and it must never need to be one.

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/__pycache__
.venv

